        "@value": "Nederlands Dans Theater: Triple Bill"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Led by artistic director Emily Molnar, NDT is committed to being an artistic conduit that allows us to see the world differently&mdash;a mission reflected in this triple bill that offers introspection, perspective, and an appreciation of dance in all its forms.&nbsp;"
      }
