    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-en",
        "@value": "In Out of the stillness, we celebrate the creative dynamism of NDT 1 through two distinct choreographic visions. Hofesh Shechter returns to NDT with a daring world premiere, his fourth creation for the company. We also revisit Gabriela Carrizo's The missing door (2013), a compelling and mysterious fusion of dance and theatre. 24 September until 19 December, 2026  Amare, The Hague 24 (premiere), 25, 26, 29, 30 September 10, 11, 12, 13 december  Practical information about your visit to Amare  Stadsschouwburg Utrecht 7 & 8 October  Schouwburg Tilburg 10 October  Internationaal Theater Amsterdam 15, 16, 17, 18 October Wilminktheater, Enschede 25 November  Parktheater, Eindhoven 28 November  SPOT, Groningen 3 December  Theater Rotterdam 18 & 19 December Dancers This performance is danced by NDT 1.  See an overview of all NDT 1 dancers Intermissions This performance contains 1 intermission. At this very moment, the duration of the performance is not yet known. This page will be updated closer to the actual performances."
      }
    ],
